3865", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974552_422911770807198_2018748843549627820_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UdauQGLYUAkQ7kNvwHj9z3X&_nc_oc=Adpnso9X_Jicy-Dav8-9B0-lF2oFIGx77ZSTJy4TujZxVSirLXvfoojx6ks7uA0uWTA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af25aMnRrjwdJA8W7AOsUC_aVfW2gNexCY4qsAm-eMmrAw&oe=69F20B28"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 4.png", "id": "1054432909633298", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974702_1054432912966631_7046083185660917993_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nh_1fnj-1MYQ7kNvwH8lGWW&_nc_oc=Adpqi-X11DvaVuY6axxQTWlojxU7ay7q4M_Eiitk9nhe9LnhBpoikR_79fCrSJC4Op0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2bSp2Uc8SXCJfh5ueCkHT-859G322dF2R077pYQO4QTA&oe=69F213A2"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 1.png", "id": "527879776285288", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75557067_527879779618621_2727265542105493653_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ckJ1FGsv_b8Q7kNvwEbZGmZ&_nc_oc=AdrpH9d9-axtiNYj80hfKlnfJO04XOwrZ67S6ZChZFscFsz7MWHiDClD4_Ra12VFOaQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af289k8SrNvvalN6jhgcNjzPiP-WFAhbLRr7NaDODc3aAg&oe=69F1F6E1"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 2.png", "id": "3704187989892735", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982651_3704187993226068_2653672913754187359_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JNPlogtkfgAQ7kNvwEzn3fL&_nc_oc=AdqgQ5teiNv2A17jt6sCuzTdocv6WVnTV3pRPT7HA8uc9LEZSjYFh4hy0fEC6e8JzJg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1YLvq-1S2sE5GEJkV_BUFNWMmlUD4u4vrbrHTuPdFqWg&oe=69F211FA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2024 HG Meta  Cover art.png", "id": "1870037076837448", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451774_1870037080170781_4936049721755154926_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5-QARrciRjAQ7kNvwGWDofo&_nc_oc=Adroca8yrngTdh9CR8OhrhnWTo5bftPraeyKuj-KyAlA-uhLXSdFo4SHX3xHbhoQwxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3r8Usnfms-f5-jckxer3J9FwGSUbUsppBoTERBCIRu_w&oe=69F1EF25"}, "display_name": "Harpagun", "keywords": ["Harpagun", "VR", "FPS", "Gun"], "long_description": "Be Harpagun. Get stranded on a deserted planet. Accidentally destroy your own rocket. Be swarmed by insane critters. Wreck stuff, throw aliens. Argue with your useless crew. Smash more enemies. Meet a girl. Have hallucinations. Listen to slav beats. Shoot living grenades.\n\nThis a game. In VR. With story and stuff. Also combat. A lot of combat. It\u2019s good - you have weapons but won\u2019t use them cause it\u2019s more fun to take a washing machine and slam it into an alien\u2019s head.\n\nYou can move stuff with a gravity ray. Enemies too, just yeet them into a wall or something and they die.\n\n\nIt\u2019s an arcade game. You know, one of the ones you actually have fun playing. Like an on-rails-shooter but not really because you can move around and don\u2019t puke. Just try it, it works. If not - return to sender, spend money on other stuff.", "short_description": "Harpagun is a fast-paced VR shooter where you smash alien critters, argue with your dysfunctional crew, and destroy everything in sight. Use weapons or everyday objects with a gravity ray to wreak havoc. Built for VR, it delivers chaotic fun, immersive combat, and a wild, hilarious storyline."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Something Random", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads":